{"repositoryId":1306741873,"availability":"available","full":"codewithdhruba01/X-Downloader","name":"X-Downloader","description":"X Media Downloader is a modern web app that lets users download videos from public X (Twitter) posts by simply pasting a post URL.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":24,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-20T15:19:19Z","updated":"2026-09-19T15:15:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://xmedia-one.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://xmedia-one.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.830Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.830Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.830Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.830Z","stars":24,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["X-Media Downloader is a premium, full-stack, glassmorphic web application built with React, Express, and TypeScript that extracts direct, downloadable MP4 video stream URLs from public Twitter/X posts.","This project does not use the official Twitter API. Instead, it leverages a reverse-engineered token calculation and queries the public Twitter Syndication API, replicating the behavior of official embedded web widgets."],"features":["High-End Design System: Modern Glassmorphic UI with dynamic animated gradients, customizable dark/light themes, and custom animations utilizing Framer Motion.","Micro-Animations: Smooth scale changes, sliding cards, and audio-style loading equalizers.","Multiple Video Resolutions: Extracts and displays all available MP4 resolutions (e.g., 1080p, 720p, 480p, 360p) sorted by quality.","Interactive Video Preview: Directly preview the video in a premium player before downloading.","Quick-Copy Stream Links: Direct buttons to copy raw CDN links or copy the post URL."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/codewithdhruba01/X-Downloader/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d60536f695aae552f2864091e7b0501011bc6d23c03683447ad6fd3b5ca1dc07","ext